  "title": "Generative model",
  "statements": [
    {
      "id": "68d2d1e9-126a-40a1-ac76-059136d77d72",
      "text": "A generative model is a probabilistic model of how sensory states are caused by hidden external states. Under the principle, a system does not need to store such a model explicitly: its states and structure encode it implicitly.",
